<title>GERMANY: Computer 2000 95/96 net loss 15.6 mln DM.</title>
<headline>Computer 2000 95/96 net loss 15.6 mln DM.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Personal computer wholesaler Computer 2000 AG said on Tuesday it made a net loss of 15.6 million marks in 1995-96 after a profit of 18.8 million marks the year before.</p>
<p>The company said it would recommend striking the divedend for the 1995-96 year, which ended September 30.</p>
<p>Group pretax profit fell to 10.1 million marks from 40.4 million marks in the 1994-95 business year, while 1995-96 sales rose 34 percent to 6.64 billion marks.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, (49-228) 260 97 150</p>
</text>
